  "body": "Property Files: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/1PBP\r\n\r\nCertificate of Title, and Code Compliance Certificate now issued.\r\n\r\nBrand new and thoughtfully designed, these four freehold homes present an exciting opportunity to secure a stylish, low-maintenance residence in a highly sought-after location. Offering two distinct floor plans to suit different lifestyles and family needs, each home combines quality finishes, natural light, and modern functionality.\r\n\r\n57A and 57B:\r\n* Open plan lounge, dining, and modern well-equipped kitchen flowing to a balcony\r\n* Lower level studio-sized bedroom with ensuite and walk-in wardrobe\r\n* Separate entrance with direct access to the outdoor entertaining area and garden\r\n* Ideal for teenagers, guests, extended family, or flatmates\r\n\r\n57C and 57D:\r\n* Open plan lounge, dining, and modern well-equipped kitchen flowing to a spacious deck\r\n* Bedroom with ensuite on the main living level, opening to its own private deck\r\n* Perfect for guests or extended family\r\n\r\nOffering 4 bedrooms and 3.5 bathrooms, all four homes are thoughtfully configured for modern family living. The upper level accommodates three bedrooms, including a master suite complete with a walk-in wardrobe and ensuite, while the remaining two bedrooms are serviced by a family bathroom.\r\n\r\nFilled with natural light and thoughtfully crafted for modern living, all four residences feature quality Bosch appliances, internal access garaging, and contemporary finishes throughout.\r\n\r\nEducation options are all sorted out, with walking distance to Sherwood School and Northcross Intermediate. You are also in zone for Rangitoto College, Long Bay College, and Murrays Bay Intermediate. Just steps away from Oaktree Reserve, you'll enjoy easy access to green open spaces and walking trails. Browns Bay Beach and Village are also within strolling distance, offering supermarkets, cafes, restaurants, shops, and a host of everyday amenities, while Albany's shopping, dining, and entertainment hub is just a short drive away.\r\n\r\nWhether you are searching for a family home, a lock-up-and-leave lifestyle, or a modern investment, these brand-new homes offer the perfect combination of flexibility, convenience, and location.\r\n\r\n*Conjunctions from all Agents welcome*",
